@startuml
' Uncomment for a light diagram:
' !$dark = %false()
!include theme.puml
hide empty members

class Experiment {
  - writer: Writer
  + run(data)
}
interface Writer {
  + write(results)
}
class CsvWriter {
  - path
  + write(results)
}
class ConsoleWriter {
  + write(results)
}
class FakeWriter {
  + write(results)
}

Experiment --> Writer : has attribute
Writer <|.. CsvWriter
Writer <|.. ConsoleWriter
Writer <|.. FakeWriter
@enduml
